  "common-default-rails/sine": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: floating_pin Rload.B\n* issue: missing_value L1\n* issue: floating_pin L1.1\n* issue: floating_pin L1.2\n* issue: value_out_of_range R2\n* issue: floating_pin R2.1\n* issue: floating_pin Q1.G\n* issue: kind_not_allowed Q1\n* issue: duplicate_name Q1\n* issue: duplicate_name Rload\n* issue: floating_pin Rload.1\n* issue: dangling_wire w2\n* issue: dangling_wire w9\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\n* issue: unconnected_port out+\nQRload vcc n1 vcc QNPN\nRL1 n2 n3 1e+4\nR2 n4 vcc 4.7e-6\nMQ1 vcc n5 vcc vcc NMOSD\nLRload n6 vcc 4.7e-6\n.model NMOSD NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-1 KP=1e-3)\n.model QNPN NPN(BF=100)\nVin in 0 SIN(5e-1 1e+0 1e+3)\nRload out outl 1e+12\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 5e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
